<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 196 0 R
/E (Ryan frequently transitions between outdoor and indoor environments using his powered wheelchair, causing his tires to collect dirt, mud, snow, salt, and debris that are tracked into his home. Cleaning the tires can be difficult and may require caregiver assistance, reducing independence and adding inconvenience to daily routines. The goal of this project is to design an accessible, low-effort tire cleaning system that allows Ryan to independently clean his wheelchair tires when entering his home.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
